<node id="&quot;HORTA-GUINARDÓ&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A district in Barcelona, Spain, with coordinates 41.42, 2.18. It is the specific location where the 'Concurs de truites de 30 Panxes 2022' event is held."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona where DiSA Sagrada Família is situated, targeting residents in areas such as Sagrada Família, Eixample Dret, Fort Pienc, Baix Guinardò, and Camp del Grassot."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona where the Biblioteca El Carmel – Juan Marsé and Biblioteca Horta-Can Mariner are located, serving as food collection points."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona, Spain, associated with the location of the 'Reina de La Paz' Social Dining Hall."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona, Spain, located at coordinates 41.43, 2.15. It is the location associated with the Ridorta ecological consumer group."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona, Spain, where Arran de terra is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona, Spain, where Colabora - Temps i Compromís is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona, Spain, where L'hort d'en Tomàs is located. It is noted for its community garden and ecological initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a district in Barcelona, Spain, where Menjador Ca la Rosa is based."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a neighborhood in Barcelona, Spain, where the community garden initiative is based."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is a neighborhood located in Barcelona, Spain, with coordinates 41.43, 2.16. It is associated with the URL https://queix.org/hort-esqueix/, though no further description or details about its significance are provided in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Horta-Guinardó is the specific neighborhood in Barcelona where the 'Horta amb Gràcia' community garden is located."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f49d3f2e8b201009007f6d9783fc48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c42d272bb558a7377c61af5f5bea1daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e276d3d1669260a4d6d3b2c0efe8a4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa7e9d35e0aa1872a96c1756aee37004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f5c6f655d72cec4e3696515f0720a7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73ed20e12af7e1e3db205621c5175e56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e0dd2da1baee94ed7fe0d48ac418849&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6acdef96c9c9504ff4c895415b34740&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67509edfa60bcd73164d2c00fe930385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4f60846b9642fadc3192bde4a3dbf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c90bf16c51081c0c1b1c427c9499da00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84bab742b139e6739f88be2bd494a110</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 231}]</data>
</node>
