<node id="&quot;CENTRE CÍVIC EL SORTIDOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Centre Cívic El Sortidor is an organization based in Barcelona, Spain, that hosts the 'A Taula! Cicle de Cultura i Gastronomia' initiative, focusing on food education, cultural exchange, and community engagement through gastronomy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Centre Cívic el Sortidor is a community center in the Poble Sec neighborhood of Barcelona, collaborating with Somlaclau to organize events promoting sustainable cooking."</data>
