<node id="&quot;AJUNTAMENT DE BARCELONA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ajuntament de Barcelona (City Council of Barcelona) is the organizing body of the 'Carrega't d'energia' program, which includes workshops on energy efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ajuntament de Barcelona is the city council that ceded the space for Benet Corner to Fundació Comtal in 2019."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ajuntament de Barcelona is the local government of Barcelona that supported the 'Veu i Brot' project, providing resources or collaboration for its implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ajuntament de Barcelona is the municipal government of Barcelona, Spain, which funds and supports the Centre Cívic El Sortidor's activities, including the 'A Taula!' project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ajuntament de Barcelona is the municipal government of Barcelona, Spain, which supports the Hort del Mercat through its Districte d’Horta Guinardó."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ajuntament de Barcelona is the municipal government that launched the 'Pla de BUITS' initiative to repurpose unused urban spaces, including the site of Hort de la Farigola."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Barcelona City Council supports the 'Horta amb Gràcia' program as part of its 'Mans al Verd' initiative, which promotes biodiversity and green spaces in the city."&lt;SEP&gt;"The City of Barcelona, which published the guide 'L’Hort escolar – Guia pràctica d’horticultura ecològica' for educational use."&lt;SEP&gt;"The municipal government of Barcelona, responsible for owning the land and supporting the community garden's development."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6e5a89d6d0f0cab41b5186208655641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dee2f903a55c6205254c0deea9feea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7ea8b92034566cf164df7a82d6971df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a35ede2b31e430f648a3b8409d3c4e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67509edfa60bcd73164d2c00fe930385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cbfad0a7fc47b6c47f816cfa3a4df7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-547f8496747ec08b08180b111c360238&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8960c499f036845cc9d56569d8b1ce5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b06ff550395a9a09dad439bc2986dc8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 172}]</data>
</node>
