  <data key="d1">"La Tavella is an organization based in Ciutat Vella, Barcelona, Spain, specializing in delivering 100% organic fruit and vegetable boxes to homes and providing a pickup point. It operates in Barcelona and all of Catalonia, with a strong commitment to social responsibility, using renewable energy, recycling, and reinvesting profits into job creation. The company employs 12 people, 42% of whom have disabilities."</data>
