<node id="&quot;MENJADOR SOLIDARI GREGAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Menjador Solidari Gregal is a community organization providing meals and social services, collaborating with various entities and running initiatives like Projecte Alimenta."&lt;SEP&gt;"Menjador solidari Gregal is a community-led meals service in Barcelona, Spain, established in 2012 as a response to the 2008 economic crisis. It provides daily meals to around 400 people, promotes social inclusion, and offers additional services like health care, legal advice, and cooking workshops."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a1996fc718a9e85ba38d6ccdbef1a89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-206012a16685f40491f7072f605811b8</data>
