<node id="&quot;AGROECOLOGÍA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agroecology is the sustainable agricultural practice central to the Jardí Fènix project, promoting environmental awareness and social inclusion through community-based farming."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7d6bd7d9f2e5a1c4a2618330bc8d3180</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUSTICIA ALIMENTARIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Food justice is a key objective of the Jardí Fènix project, addressing inequalities in food access through the donation of produce to initiatives like La Botiga."&lt;SEP&gt;"Food justice refers to the initiative's goal of creating a fairer and more equitable food system through the donation of agroecological produce to projects like La Botiga."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7d6bd7d9f2e5a1c4a2618330bc8d3180</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPODERAMIENTO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
